hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2860","Narrated to us Muhammad bin Al-Ala bin Kurayb and Harun bin Ishaq, who both said: Narrated to us Abu Khalid, narrated to us Ibn Jurayj. And Harun said: From Ibn Jurayj, from Abu Az-Zubayr, from Abu Ma'bad, from Ibn Abbas, from Al-Fadl, who said: \"The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) departed from Arafah and from Muzdalifah with tranquility upon him until he arrived at Mina.\""
